# Clone Dashboard Webpage with Angular

Cloning the provided "n-sure OFI" dashboard images into a clean, readable, and responsive Angular application.

## Proposed Changes

### [Web Application]

#### [NEW] [src/app/layout/sidebar](file:///Users/ralein/Desktop/Project/UI/src/app/layout/sidebar)
Collapsible sidebar with navigation icons as seen in the images.

#### [NEW] [src/app/layout/header](file:///Users/ralein/Desktop/Project/UI/src/app/layout/header)
Top navigation bar with logo, search (if applicable), and user profile.

#### [NEW] [src/app/features/dashboard](file:///Users/ralein/Desktop/Project/UI/src/app/features/dashboard)
Main dashboard view containing:
- Stat cards (Active, Revoked, Expired, Suspended Consents).
- Charts (Donut, Bar, Pie) using Chart.js.
- Filters (Year, Month).

#### [NEW] [src/app/features/consent-management](file:///Users/ralein/Desktop/Project/UI/src/app/features/consent-management)
Table view for managing consents with search and pagination.

#### [NEW] [src/app/features/consent-details](file:///Users/ralein/Desktop/Project/UI/src/app/features/consent-details)
Detailed view for a specific consent with summary info and expandable sections.

#### [MODIFY] [src/styles.css](file:///Users/ralein/Desktop/Project/UI/src/styles.css)
Global styles to match the color palette (dark blue, light gray backgrounds) and typography.

## Verification Plan

### Automated Tests
- `ng test`: Run unit tests for core components.
- `ng lint`: Ensure code quality follows Angular best practices.

### Manual Verification
1.  **Dashboard Layout**: Verify the sidebar is collapsible and the layout shifts correctly.
2.  **Chart Rendering**: Ensure charts display data correctly and match the visual style of the images.
3.  **Table Functionality**: Test search and (mock) pagination in the Consent Management view.
4.  **Responsive Design**: Verify the UI looks good on different screen sizes (Desktop, Tablet).
